+| 97 | `memberInt` | `Int × Exprs -> Bool`; `[function]` |
+| 102–103 | `conditionalAppend` | `Bool × String × String -> String`; `[function,total]` |
+
+The configuration at lines 62–68 has one computation cell and three state
